## 🔴 Pain Points Identified

### 1. **Sequential Blocking**
| Pain | Impact | Frequency |
|:-----|:-------|:----------|
| Wait for research before coding | Lost time | Every research task |
| Wait for me to finish long responses | Idle time | Every session |
| Context switching between threads | Mental fatigue | Daily |

### 2. **Context Reloading**
| Pain | Impact | Frequency |
|:-----|:-------|:----------|
| Re-explaining project context | 5-10 min per session | Every new thread |
| Forgetting previous decisions | Rework | Weekly |
| Lost momentum after breaks | Slow restart | Daily |

### 3. **Quality Gaps**
| Pain | Impact | Frequency |
|:-----|:-------|:----------|
| No systematic review before deploy | Bugs in prod | Occasional |
| Tests written after, not before | Harder to debug | Common |
| No automated quality gates | Manual checking | Always |

